flowchart TD
    Init[Origin Lab Manager Initiates Transfer<br/>Selects Asset & Destination Lab] --> CheckCondition{Is Asset Condition<br/>OPERATIONAL?}
    
    CheckCondition -- No --> Block[Transfer Blocked:<br/>Asset is Defective or Under Maintenance]
    
    CheckCondition -- Yes --> SetPending[Asset State: TRANSFER_PENDING<br/>Transfer State: PENDING_RECEIVER]
    SetPending --> AlertTarget[Destination Lab Manager Receives Alert]
    
    AlertTarget --> TargetInspect{Destination Manager<br/>Inspects & Accepts?}
    TargetInspect -- Rejects --> RejectTarget[Transfer State: REJECTED<br/>Asset State Restored: OPERATIONAL]
    
    TargetInspect -- Accepts --> SetULMDPending[Transfer State: PENDING_ULMD]
    SetULMDPending --> ULMDAlert[ULMD Directorate Receives Request]
    
    ULMDAlert --> ULMDReview{ULMD Directorate<br/>Approves Relocation?}
    ULMDReview -- Denies --> DenyULMD[Transfer State: REJECTED<br/>Asset Retained by Origin Lab]
    
    ULMDReview -- Approves --> Execute[Update asset.laboratory_id & asset.room_id<br/>Transfer State: COMPLETED<br/>Asset State: OPERATIONAL]
    Execute --> Audit[(Write Immutable Audit Log<br/>Action: TRANSFER_COMPLETED)]
    Audit --> Finish([Relocation Finalized & Tracked])
